    "sections": {
        "description": "The Deep Cleaning Theme is a sleek, high-performing template built for businesses offering residential, commercial, move-in, post-construction, emergency, Airbnb, and eco-conscious sanitation services. Ideal for cleaning companies, janitorial service providers, maid services, carpet and upholstery cleaners, disinfection experts, and health-focused home service professionals, this theme combines visual professionalism with practical functionality. With a modern layout and intuitive interface, it features dedicated sections for service showcases, rate charts, client reviews, FAQs, and booking forms—ensuring a smooth user journey that builds trust and drives inquiries. Optimized for mobile responsiveness, fast loading, and search engine performance, it supports keywords like house deep cleaning, office sanitization, post-renovation cleaning, green cleaning, and recurring cleaning packages. The theme includes integration support for the Contact Form 7 plugin, making customer interaction seamless. Built-in eCommerce compatibility allows selling cleaning service bundles or offering subscription-based plans, while social media integration and custom banners boost outreach and brand recall. Designed to streamline scheduling, highlight service quality, and improve customer engagement, this template is the perfect digital solution for any business in the cleanliness, hygiene, and professional home care industry."
    },
